# A release checklist for a repository that is not this one

Two states are kept apart at every item, and every item below is filed under one
of them. The closing section states a figure that is not the number of items in
the second state.

## A condition a run answers

Decided by a run. The `Pull request hygiene` check is the verdict, and what it
promises an operator is written in `docs/limits.md` rather than here.

## A condition nobody answers yet

Nothing decides this yet. The route is owed by #1, and until it lands somebody
answers this by hand at every release.

## When an item has no answer

Two of the items above have no route that answers them at all. `LimitsPageTests`
is named here so the leg that resolves a suite has something to resolve on a page
that is otherwise about nothing.
